OL,3,GNEWSA'Unclaimed' #40.7m in little-known
OL,4,Apensioner benefit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department for Work and Pensions
OL,7,Fspokesperson challenged the figures but
OL,8,Fsaid: "We want everyone who is entitled
OL,9,Fto Attendance Allowance to be able to
OL,10,Faccess the support they need."
